    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d544">

                <pb facs="0893" n="877" sameAs="frus:frus1951v07p1/pg877"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">740.5/9–451</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of Defense</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Marshall</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">top secret</hi>
                    </seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1951-09-04">September 4,
                        1951</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Dear Mr. Secretary</hi>: Attached hereto are the
                    comments of the Joint Chiefs of Staff with respect to the draft position paper
                    (WFM T–10) entitled “UN Action in Korea in Case of an Armistice”, dated 18
                    August 1951, prepared for use in the Washington Foreign Ministers Meetings
                    (Tripartite Talks).</p>
                <p>I concur in the comments of the Joint Chiefs of Staff.</p>
                <p>The following additional changes to the paper are also suggested:</p>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">a</hi>. Under <hi rendition="#italic">U.S.
                        Objective</hi> (page 1)</p>
                <quote rend="blockquote">
                    <p>“To achieve a unified independent and democratic Korea with maximum assurance
                        against Communist <del rendition="#strikethrough">domination</del>
                        <hi rendition="#italic">subversion or aggression</hi>.”</p>
                </quote>
                <pb facs="0894" n="878" xml:id="pg878"/>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">b</hi>. Under <hi rendition="#italic">Position to be
                        Presented</hi> (page 1)</p>
                <quote rend="blockquote">
                    <p>“3. <hi rendition="#italic">a</hi>. Establishment under UN supervision of a
                        unified, independent and democratic Korea<del rendition="#strikethrough"
                            >,</del>
                        <del rendition="#strikethrough">assured,</del>
                        <del rendition="#strikethrough">insofar</del>
                        <del rendition="#strikethrough">as</del>
                        <del rendition="#strikethrough">possible,</del>
                        <del rendition="#strikethrough">against</del>
                        <del rendition="#strikethrough">Communist</del>
                        <del rendition="#strikethrough">domination,</del>
                        <hi rendition="#italic">with maximum assurance against Communist subversion
                            or aggression.</hi>”</p>
                    <p>“3. <hi rendition="#italic">c</hi>. “Plan for phased withdrawal of foreign
                        forces with <del rendition="#strikethrough">reasonable</del>
                        <hi rendition="#italic">maximum</hi> assurances against <del
                            rendition="#strikethrough">internal</del>
                        <del rendition="#strikethrough">disorder</del>
                        <del rendition="#strikethrough">and</del>
                        <del rendition="#strikethrough">external</del>
                        <del rendition="#strikethrough">aggression.</del>
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Communist subversion or aggression</hi>.”</p>
                </quote>
                <p>Faithfully yours,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>G. C. <hi rendition="#small-caps">Marshall</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>


                <xi:include href="d544-a1.xml" xpointer="d544-a1"/>
